    "m_FunctionBody": "float beatPos = UV.y * TotalBeats;\nfloat colPos = UV.x * Columns;\n\nfloat beatFrac = abs(frac(beatPos + 0.5) - 0.5);\nfloat halfFrac = abs(frac(beatPos * 2.0 + 0.5) - 0.5);\nfloat subFrac = abs(frac(beatPos * BSD + 0.5) - 0.5);\nfloat colFrac = abs(frac(colPos + 0.5) - 0.5);\n\nfloat beatLine = 1.0 - saturate(beatFrac / LineThickness);\nfloat halfLine = 1.0 - saturate(halfFrac / (LineThickness * 0.75));\nfloat subLine = 1.0 - saturate(subFrac / (LineThickness * 0.5));\nfloat colLine = 1.0 - saturate(colFrac / (LineThickness * 0.8));\n\nfloat4 color = BgColor;\ncolor = lerp(color, ColumnLineColor, colLine * ColumnLineColor.a);\ncolor = lerp(color, SubBeatColor, subLine * SubBeatColor.a);\ncolor = lerp(color, HalfBeatColor, halfLine * HalfBeatColor.a);\ncolor = lerp(color, BeatLineColor, beatLine * BeatLineColor.a);\n\nOutColor = color;"
}

